@Authdoc_HostAddress = http://localhost:5297
@Token = <token retornado pelo login>

### Login
POST {{Authdoc_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@system.com",
  "password": "<SeedData:AdminPassword>"
}

### Identidade do token
GET {{Authdoc_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Listar usuarios
GET {{Authdoc_HostAddress}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

###
